OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry clear
OL,6,Fevening. Dry and settled overnight
OL,7,Fwith light winds and largely clear
OL,8,Fskies. Turning cold again, with a
OL,9,Ffrost developing across many areas by
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAnother cold start with a risk
OL,13,Fof frost in places. Remaining dry and
OL,14,Fsettled during the day with lengthy
OL,15,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
